{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19963","headline":"济源春 · 孟郊","name":"济源春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太行横偃脊，百里芳崔巍。\n济滨花异颜，枋口云如裁。\n新画彩色湿，上界光影来。\n深红缕草木，浅碧珩泝洄。\n千家门前饮，一道传禊杯。\n玉鳞吞金钩，仙璇瑠璃开。\n朴童茂言语，善俗无惊猜。\n狂吹寝恒宴，晓清梦先回。\n治生鲜惰夫，积学多深材。\n再游讵癫戆，一洗惊尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}